              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.9.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Aeburania 9:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Siku ya phiriye Musa ariphomenya ndani ya hema ra ushaidi, ndata ya Aruni kula mbari ya Lawi kala ikatsephula makodza matsanga, ikabumula maruwa na kuvyala matunda maivu ga mlozi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Musa achizihala zo ndata zosi kula mbere za Mwenyezi Mlungu na achiziika mbere za Aiziraeli osi, nao achizilola na chila chilongozi achihala ndataye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Mwenyezi Mlungu achigomba na Musa achimuamba, “Yiuyize yo ndata ya Aruni mbere ya sanduku ra chilagane, kpwa ikale ushaidi kpwa aasi, ili usise ko kururumika kpwao arikonirurumikira, sedze akafwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa achihenda vira arivyolagizwa ni Mwenyezi Mlungu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aiziraeli achimuambira Musa, “Lola, sambi! Hunafwa! Hunaangamia! Hosi hunaangamia! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutu yeyesi ndiyesengerera hema ra Mwenyezi Mlungu andafwa. Vino tahundafwa hosi bu?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
